{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2025-01", "window": 2, "start_date": 1736294400, "end_date": 1736985599, "month_true_total": 765, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:18:56 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "185675560", "author": {"steamid": "76561198029581273", "personaname": "ChillinVillian", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198029581273/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 147891, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 507, "playtime_at_review": 133486, "last_played": 1790542100, "avatar": "acf67207768cdc5be5f09aca6a9f7830bf27d6f7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game, great modding community with so much variety of modification. You can definitely find what ever play style you want with this game.", "timestamp_created": 1736981439, "timestamp_updated": 1736981439, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185663664", "author": {"steamid": "76561199236764065", "personaname": "Onaith", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Onaithral/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 4759, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3642, "last_played": 1787774957, "avatar": "f50f36cd3012004502b70cc3ab4dc897d9a3d662"}, "language": "english", "review": "fena", "timestamp_created": 1736967691, "timestamp_updated": 1736967691, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185662198", "author": {"steamid": "76561198131409827", "personaname": "steven_be11_", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198131409827/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 109927, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 927, "playtime_at_review": 17084, "last_played": 1790530074, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "awesome", "timestamp_created": 1736966168, "timestamp_updated": 1736966168, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185661040", "author": {"steamid": "76561199583342617", "personaname": "Xuru", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199583342617/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 3629, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3216, "last_played": 1737414213, "avatar": "a6fa0f687b6b087d729aaadc515ac0286c93825c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Arma 3 is a gem for players who crave deep tactical gameplay and immersive military simulation. It's not your typical shooter; instead, it's an intricate sandbox where strategy, teamwork, and realism take center stage.\n\nThe game offers a vast open-world environment on two massive maps, Altis and Stratis, each beautifully detailed and perfect for diverse military operations. Whether you're into single-player campaigns or multiplayer battles, Arma 3 provides endless opportunities to create and participate in unique scenarios.\n\nThe gameplay emphasizes realism, from ballistics and vehicle physics to communication and logistics. It's challenging at first, especially for newcomers, but the learning curve is part of the reward. Once you get the hang of it, every mission feels like an accomplishment.\n\nOne of Arma 3's strongest aspects is its community. The modding scene is incredibly active, offering countless mods, missions, and enhancements that extend the game's lifespan. Whether you want to add new factions, weapons, or completely change the gameplay with total conversions, the workshop has something for everyone.\n\nWhile the game can be demanding on hardware and the AI isn't perfect, these are minor setbacks compared to the overall experience. If you're looking for a tactical, immersive, and rewarding military game, Arma 3 is unmatched.\n\nRating: 9/10. A must-play for any fan of military simulation or sandbox games!", "timestamp_created": 1736964992, "timestamp_updated": 1736964992, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185659178", "author": {"steamid": "76561199395581902", "personaname": "Snake Porter", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/snakePorter/", "num_games_owned": 48, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 805, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 700, "last_played": 1736989479, "avatar": "2a312a2210d41a8051e4787ea94ba7a341bfc0cd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Best milsim Ive ever played", "timestamp_created": 1736963084, "timestamp_updated": 1736963084, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}]}